---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { SHOPEE_24S } from '../data/produk';
---
<section class="bg-charcoal-dark py-16 text-stone-100">
  <div class="
    mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 px-6
    text-center
    md:flex-row md:text-left
    lg:px-12
  ">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h3 class="
        text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight
        md:text-3xl
      ">Mulai dengan Koleksi Esensial Halvora</h3>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-sm text-stone-400">Checkout langsung lewat Shopee, dengan pembayaran dan pengiriman yang sudah kamu kenal.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="
      btn-interactive inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm
      bg-shopee-orange px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide
      whitespace-nowrap text-white
      hover:bg-shopee-orange-hover
      btn-sheen
    " href={SHOPEE_24S} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
      <Icon name="store" class="size-4" /><span>Kunjungi Toko Shopee</span><Icon name="arrow-right" class="
        size-4
      " />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
